#: ../../source/overview.rst:2
msgid "项目概览"
msgstr "Overview"




#: ../../source/overview.rst:4
msgid "OpenFoD 是社区主导的开源重铸，目标是让 2001 年目标软件奥世工作室的《傲世三国》（海外名 *Fate of the Dragon*）在现代系统上重新可玩。它不是原作的再发行，也不附带商业数据包。"
msgstr "OpenFoD is a community-led open-source recast. The goal is to make Object Software’s 2001 Fate of the Dragon (傲世三国) playable on modern systems. It is not a rerelease and it does not ship commercial data packs."




#: ../../source/overview.rst:6
msgid "原作不是红警式的纯兵线对冲，也不走三国志的回合棋盘。玩家同时治理一座城、注视一片山河：税率、民心、农桑与翰林科研在城内运转；出城则是野战、攻城与破门后的巷战。"
msgstr "The original is not a Red Alert arms race, nor a Romance of the Three Kingdoms board. You govern a city and watch a realm at once: taxes, morale, farming and Hanlin research inside the walls; field battles, sieges and street fighting beyond them."




#: ../../source/overview.rst:8
msgid "它是第一款在 E3 正式展出的中国游戏，后由 Eidos 以 Fate of the Dragon 之名发行。二十余年后，原作受困于旧系统与分辨率。OpenFoD 要做的，是把这座城重新点亮。"
msgstr "It was the first Chinese game formally shown at E3, later published by Eidos as Fate of the Dragon. Two decades on, the original strains against modern OS and resolutions. OpenFoD exists to light that city again."




