msgid "OpenFod-Website"
msgstr "OpenFod-Website"


#: ../../source/overview.rst:24
msgid "官网 https://www.openfod.org ，GitHub Pages 托管"
msgstr "Website https://www.openfod.org , hosted on GitHub Pages"




#: ../../source/overview.rst:26
msgid "文档站编译后填充到官网的 ``/docs/`` 路径，中文在 ``/docs/zh/``，英文在 ``/docs/en/``。"
msgstr "The compiled docs are placed at ``/docs/`` on the website: Chinese at ``/docs/zh/``, English at ``/docs/en/``."




#: ../../source/overview.rst:29
msgid "重铸原则"
msgstr "Rewrite principles"




#: ../../source/overview.rst:31
msgid "游戏源码仓库是一次 **按层提取的重写**，而不是把旧工程修到能过关："
msgstr "The game repository is a **layered extraction rewrite**, not a repair of the previous project until it barely passes:"




#: ../../source/overview.rst:33
msgid "**保留** 原作二进制格式知识和手搓的内容数据。这些字节偏移只存在于 2001 年的闭源程序里，没有第二份规格可抄。"
msgstr "**Keep** original binary format knowledge and hand-curated content. Those byte offsets exist only inside a 2001 closed-source binary; no second specification exists."




#: ../../source/overview.rst:34
msgid "**保留** 行为测试作为规格。旧工程文档极短，测试才是“游戏到底怎么动”的权威。"
msgstr "**Keep** behavioural tests as the specification. The previous docs were tiny; the tests are the authority for how the game actually moves."




#: ../../source/overview.rst:35
msgid "**重写** 规则引擎与 Godot 表现层：一个事实只有一个权威来源，每一条工程规则都由会失败的脚本守门。"
msgstr "**Rewrite** the rules engine and Godot presentation: one authority per fact, and every engineering rule is a script that can fail."




#: ../../source/overview.rst:38
msgid "法律与资源"
msgstr "Legal and assets"




#: ../../source/overview.rst:40
msgid "本站与游戏仓库都不分发 ``SANGGO.exe``、``Res/*.dll``、战役语音或原版地图。"
msgstr "Neither this site nor the game repository redistributes ``SANGGO.exe``, ``Res/*.dll``, campaign voice lines, or original maps."




#: ../../source/overview.rst:41
msgid "开发者若要跑需要原作文件的解码测试，在本机设置 ``FOD_GAME_ROOT``，指向未打包的原版安装目录。"
msgstr "Developers who need decoder tests that require original files set ``FOD_GAME_ROOT`` on their machine to an unpacked retail install."




#: ../../source/overview.rst:42
msgid "《傲世三国》与 Fate of the Dragon 为原权利方之商标与作品。OpenFoD 向经典致敬，与目标软件、Overmax Studios、Eidos Interactive 无隶属关系。"
msgstr "Fate of the Dragon and 傲世三国 are trademarks of their rights holders. OpenFoD is an homage and is not affiliated with Object Software, Overmax Studios, or Eidos Interactive."




